 "teaches": [
  "Each product is {title, subtitle, meta: price, lead, label, body, detail}: detail is any node, here a Rating, KeyValueRows and a Button, so the product page is the caller's while the list, the panes and back are the component's",
  "Add to cart sits in the detailEnd slot, written once under whichever product is shown, and sends hostNamedAction addToCart with the selected index (\"@sel\")",
  "label gives each row its spoken text (name, price, rating) since the price sits at the row's end"
 ],
